@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v2

### ==========================================
### AA02: AUTENTICACAO EXTERNA
### O login completo requer um browser (ecra de consentimento no IdP):
### abrir {{baseUrl}}/auth/external/google/login no browser.
### Os pedidos abaixo cobrem apenas o que pode ser verificado sem um IdP.
### ==========================================

### 1.1 Fornecedores ativos (200 OK, sem segredos expostos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/external/providers

?? status == 200
?? header cache-control == no-store
?? js response.parsedBody[0].name exists
?? js response.parsedBody[0].clientSecret isUndefined

### 1.2 Fornecedor desconhecido (404 PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/external/facebook/login

?? status == 404
?? js response.parsedBody.error.code == PROVIDER_NOT_FOUND

### 1.3 Nome de fornecedor mal formatado (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/external/GOOGLE-1/login

?? status == 404

### 1.4 Inicio de login: redirecionamento para o IdP + cookie de transacao (requer Google configurado)
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/external/google/login

?? status == 302
?? header location includes accounts.google.com
?? js String(response.headers['set-cookie'] ?? '').includes('lp_oidc') == true
?? js String(response.headers['set-cookie'] ?? '').includes('HttpOnly') == true

### 1.5 Callback apos cancelamento do utilizador no IdP: sem sessao (302 para a SPA)
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/external/google/callback?error=access_denied&state=x

?? status == 302
?? header location includes status=error
?? header location includes code=ACCESS_DENIED
?? js !String(response.headers['set-cookie'] ?? '').includes('lp_rt')

### 1.6 Callback sem cookie de transacao: sem sessao
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/external/google/callback?code=abc&state=x

?? status == 302
?? header location includes code=AUTH_FAILED
?? js !String(response.headers['set-cookie'] ?? '').includes('lp_rt')